1
00:00:04,736 --> 00:00:07,936
(Amy:)So, Howard, is Stuart still
living with your mom?

2
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:09,770
(Howard:)I don't want
to talk about it.

3
00:00:09,775 --> 00:00:12,105
(Bernadette:)But he's going to.
My mom got him cable!

4
00:00:12,111 --> 00:00:14,281
(Howard:)In my whole life,

5
00:00:14,279 --> 00:00:16,009
(Howard:)growing up
in that house-- no cable.

6
00:00:16,014 --> 00:00:17,484
(Howard:)Do you know how many HBOs

7
00:00:17,483 --> 00:00:19,513
(Howard:)that leech had my mother
get him? Seven.

8
00:00:19,518 --> 00:00:21,948
Seven HBOs. Seven!

9
00:00:21,954 --> 00:00:25,694
(Bernadette:)Long story short,
they have seven HBOs.

10
00:00:25,691 --> 00:00:27,021
(knocking)
Hey, guys.

11
00:00:27,025 --> 00:00:28,955
(Raj:)Hey.
Hello.
Hey.

12
00:00:28,961 --> 00:00:30,891
(Raj:)Emily, you know
almost everybody here.
Hi.

13
00:00:30,896 --> 00:00:32,696
(Raj:)This is Leonard,
this is Penny.

14
00:00:32,698 --> 00:00:34,068
(Emily:)Oh, it's so nice
to meet you.

15
00:00:34,066 --> 00:00:35,736
(Leonard:)Nice to finally
meet you, too.
Hi.

16
00:00:35,734 --> 00:00:36,964
(Sheldon:)Hello.

17
00:00:36,969 --> 00:00:39,369
Well, Raj,
you were not lying about her.

18
00:00:39,371 --> 00:00:42,201
(Raj:)I told you
she exists.

19
00:00:42,207 --> 00:00:44,207
(Penny:)Hey, I hear you're
a dermatologist.

20
00:00:44,209 --> 00:00:47,249
(Emily:)Uh, yeah, I'm a resident
at Huntington Hospital.

21
00:00:47,246 --> 00:00:49,776
(Sheldon:)Oh, I like their
emergency room.

22
00:00:49,781 --> 00:00:52,651
(Sheldon:)Yeah, even if it turns out
you don't have Dengue fever,

23
00:00:52,651 --> 00:00:54,881
(Sheldon:)they still let you
take a lollipop.

24
00:00:56,155 --> 00:00:57,785
(Bernadette:)You know, Penny
just started training

25
00:00:57,789 --> 00:00:59,559
(Bernadette:)to be a pharmaceutical
sales rep.

26
00:00:59,558 --> 00:01:01,658
(Bernadette:)Maybe she can practice
on you some time.

